        "Description": "Big problem 47,\r\rIt appears that Adam, or &quot;Harold&quot; as some people know him as, is actually the product of a secret cloning project. He (they?) have seemingly escaped the lab and been hiding in secret for over 7 years. We are not sure how many, if any, people know of his existence but cannot let this secret get out. You know what to do.",
